twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot declare `UnsafeSend` for `Mixed`: field `fn` has type `(Int) escaping -> Int`, which is not `Send` and is not an unsafe type
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot declare `UnsafeSend` for `Mixed`: field `fn` has type `(Int) escaping -> Int`, which is not `Send` and is not an unsafe type"
